<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Bendigo Bank year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bendigo Bank year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    17.81 vs  22.01</p>
<p>    Net profit			    11.04 vs  12.73</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		9.0 vs  12.00</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     21.0 vs  23.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Bendigo Bank Ltd is a regional-based bank in Victoria. Bendigo said in late June it expected pre-tax earnings in 1996/97 would be about 20 percent down because of sharp competition for housing finance.</p>
</text>
